    "details": {
      "alignment": "Lawful Evil",
      "type": {
        "value": "undead",
        "subtype": "vampire"
      },
      "cr": 5,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Orangus Cornelius.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, hand-authored from the article. XP ledger: level 5, power rating 11 → CR 5 as a boss. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Defenestrated Lord</strong> — Onyx Hand / House Corvinarus (Shadowfell branch)</p><p>Status: Active (Barely) — Shot with silver, tackled out a window, and deeply humiliated</p><p>Orangus Cornelius was the senior vampire lord of the Shadow Estate and a figure of absolute authority. Then Green T shot him with a silver bullet from the children's table. Unfortunately, Cornelius survived. Instead of dying gracefully, he turned into a giant bat, got tackled through a window by Bowser, and watched his precious dimensional Anchor get shattered. Waluigi considers surviving this sequence of events physically impressive but socially fatal.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Bite</strong> — “In the ensuing wrestling match, Bowser actually bit Cornelius's wing.”</li><li><strong>Claws (Bat Form)</strong> — “Vampire (Giant Bat Form)”</li><li><strong>Multiattack</strong> — “Vampire (Giant Bat Form)”</li><li><strong>Giant Bat Form</strong> — “Instead, he dropped the aristocratic pretense and transformed into a giant bat monster.”</li><li><strong>Dinner Party Dominance</strong> — “Orangus's dinner parties were exercises in vampire social dominance.”</li><li><strong>Defenestrated</strong> — “Instead of dying gracefully, he turned into a giant bat, got tackled through a window by Bowser, and watched his precious dimensional Anchor get shattered.”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/orangus_cornelius</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/orangus_cornelius</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
